{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026J8dVew5VzU1794563471.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產沙田豪宅沙田站第二分行資深分區營業經理潘婉兒表示，近日交投氣氛正面，吸引投資者入市，分行最新錄火炭星凱．堤岸1座中層C室，單位實用面積228平方呎，開放式間隔，日前議價後連租約以430萬元獲承接，實用面積平均呎價18,860元。<br/>據了解，新買家為投資者，見單位價錢合理，即決定入市單位收租，單位租約月租15,000元，買家可享約4.2厘租金回報。據了解，原業主於2021年以574萬元購入單位，持貨約5年，是次轉手賬面上蝕約144萬元或25%離場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T08:37:48.110351+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":228,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T07:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T12:10:57.735114+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T08:31:37.222412+00:00","content_hash":"70504ba0e4673613db94a60a288e8dc17223dc24f44d25261f22d59a6169f4f2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-15T08:37:48.110351+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}